<title>SINGAPORE: TAIWAN'S HOTUNG IPO OVER 10 TIMES SUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>TAIWAN'S HOTUNG IPO OVER 10 TIMES SUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 48.4 million shares offered to the public by Hotung Investment Holdings Ltd were over 10 times subscribed, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Hotung, Taiwan's largest venture capital invesment group, has offered a total of 242.4 million new shares at US$0.26 each of which 193.9 million were placed out.</p>
<p>Trading of the shares on the main board of the Stock Exchange of Singapore will start on Monday, August 11.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
